{{- if .HasNode }}

- Node: prefer `npm` scripts (`npm run build`, `npm test`) unless the
  lockfile names another manager.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasGo }}

- Go: `go build ./...`, `go test ./...`, `gofmt -l .`, `go vet ./...`.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasPython }}

- Python: use the project virtualenv (`.venv`) and `python -m pytest`.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasRust }}

- Rust: `cargo build`, `cargo test`, `cargo clippy`.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasCSharp }}

- C#: install `ms-dotnettools.csharp` for C# language support.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasJava }}

- Java: install `redhat.java` for Java language support.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasRuby }}

- Ruby: install `Shopify.ruby-lsp` for Ruby language support.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasErlang }}

- Erlang: install `erlang-ls.erlang-ls` for Erlang language support.{{- end }}
{{- if .HasBun }}

- Bun: install `oven.bun-vscode` for Bun runtime support.{{- end }}
{{- if contains .Frameworks "vue" }}

- Vue: install `Vue.volar` for Vue support.{{- end }}
{{- if contains .Frameworks "nuxt" }}

- Nuxt: install `Vue.volar` for Vue support.{{- end }}
{{- if contains .Frameworks "svelte" }}

- Svelte: install `svelte.svelte-vscode` for Svelte support.{{- end }}
{{- if contains .Frameworks "sveltekit" }}

- SvelteKit: install `svelte.svelte-vscode` for Svelte support.{{- end }}
{{- if contains .Frameworks "astro" }}

- Astro: install `astro-build.astro-vscode` for Astro support.{{- end }}
